n.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Serum and RBC folate were measured by the same analyst in the NHANES Central Laboratory for both NHANES III and NHANES 1999.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The overall > 6 year mean coefficient of variation for serum and RBC folate was 5%.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}